 no frills and pure tag action, it\u2019s all about movement, momentum, and mastering the terrain to escape or catch your friends. Simple, chaotic fun.\n", "short_description": "Lethal Ape: Original is a fast-paced, social VR tag game where players chase, dodge, and outsmart each other in immersive maps. Compete with friends, master movement, and experience intense multiplayer action!\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Tuff Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hrR72M0NkZH_Yns16mbLYnLLS6sQ2_69DU5ZToFhOQQ/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tuff Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/lethal-ape-original/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25335935762659266"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1849351345930720"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1849351345930720"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1763042760, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1849351345930720"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "25336173279302181", "version": "1.3"}, "id": "1126054365847281", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_key